In article <36da7g$5vn@emalpha2.em.doe.gov>,
Russ Russell  <russ.russell@em.doe.gov> wrote:
>My machine came with an extra 2.1 gig (RZ28) SCSI hard drive. I installed
>it and figured that it wouldn't be hard to get it in, partitioned, and 
