there should be absolutly no reason to recompile after upgrading
from osf1.2 to v3.0. You will however go from Motif 1.1.3 to Motif 1.2.3
if you do recompile, (Motif 1.2.3 is much, much cleaner than Motif 1.1.3)
and also be able to take advantage on a number of performance improvements.

