There are a number of performance changes between v1.2 and v3.0 that
have a side effect of bing much less forgiving to programming bugs
in application programs. Two that come to mind are changes in malloc
and the movement of const data in the libraries. Both of the 
changes are great performance boosts but occasionaly find programs
that may have relied more space being alloacted that was asked for
for example.

