mats (mats@royac1.astro.su.se) wrote:

> What is involved in making an Alpha OSF 1 computer
> 1) Receive 8-bit email?
> 2) Send 8-bit email?



You can receive and send 8-bit characters with the standard sendmail 
on DEC Alpha OSF/1 :

2 methods of doing this :
 
 - use the -o8 flag to make the frozen configuration (sendmail.fc):
      /usr/lib/sendmail -o8 -bz

 - set the flag '8' in the mailers description:
      For example:  Msmtpr, P=[IPC], F=mDFMuX8, S=13, R=23, A=IPC $h, E=\r\n


