OSF/1.  My set-up is a DEC 3000/300 running OSF/1 version 2.0 --- PPP
seems pretty stable with that configuration, but I have no idea how it
works on other configurations (for example, I don't know if it will
work with version 1.3 of OSF/1).  Note that in my distribution I have
only included code that I have changed and debugged.  In particular, I
have NOT ported the "chat" program that normally comes with ppp-2.1.2.

