zaphod.csci.unt.edu (129.120.3.72), as file /pub/ppp-2.1.2-osf.tgz (it's
a gzip'ed tar file).  After unpacking, you should read the README.osf file
in the unpacked directory --- as stated there, I would like everyone who
is using this port to send me e-mail.  Since this is a first release, there
may very well be bugs, and I would like to be able to contact people if
any bugs are found/fixed.  I am *ESPECIALLY* interested in e-mail from
people who get this software running on different configurations (esp.
other versions of OSF/1).


