I have been working on this for some time.  What I have is a version
of GNU gprof version that works on the Alpha, provided you use GCC
2.6.0 or newer (I don't know about G++, but if it doesn't work
already, it should be pretty easy to fix it).  You also need new
versions of mcount/monitor etc., which I can provide (they were
derived from the NetBSD source).  One caveat: Digitial does not
provide a profiled library (libc_p), so you won't be able to see calls
to library functions.

I'm still playing around with various gprof enhancements, so it's not
ready for public distribution, but if anybody is interested, I could
create a binutils-2.4 relative tar file that produces a gprof for the
Alphas.

